1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:02,920
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) You cannot kill a person.

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,740
That is against the law.

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:07,860
You will go to jail.

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:11,560
You cannot kill someone else's dog.

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,700
That is against the law too.

6
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:18,160
You can kill an ant.

7
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,620
No one likes ants.

8
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,260
Ants eat your food.

9
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,460
Ants invade your house.

10
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:30,920
Killing ants is not against the law.
